      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503602",
      "subQuestName": "Reach the end of the Abyssal corridor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150360201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150360201": {
            "id": "150360201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh... Looks like this is a dead end. Did we make it to his hiding place?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360202"
            ]
          },
          "150360202": {
            "id": "150360202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, this fog is making it impossible to see anything!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360203"
            ]
          },
          "150360203": {
            "id": "150360203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "#This should be the place where you were attacked, {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360204"
            ]
          },
          "150360204": {
            "id": "150360204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "The missing part of your soul should be nearby. Can you sense where it is?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360205"
            ]
          },
          "150360205": {
            "id": "150360205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(If I close my eyes and focus on the light that came from my wound back then... Yes, I can sense something, and it is nearby. But I can't tell the exact location.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360208"
            ]
          },
          "150360208": {
            "id": "150360208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Hmm. Our opponent must have covered his tracks just in case. Otherwise, you should have sensed it much more strongly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360209"
            ]
          },
          "150360209": {
            "id": "150360209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hold on, look! The spikes are back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360210"
            ]
          },
          "150360210": {
            "id": "150360210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Stay calm. Let's hold back a little, give our enemy some wiggle room so we can see what we're dealing with. If we're too reckless, we might be playing right into his hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360211"
            ]
          },
          "150360211": {
            "id": "150360211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Our enemy took part of your soul for a reason — it's likely he integrated it into his attacks somehow. If we're smart about this, we can track it down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503608",
      "subQuestName": "Evade the spikes",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503603",
      "subQuestName": "Evade the spikes",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150360301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150360301": {
            "id": "150360301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Ah, {NICKNAME}, Skirk!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360302"
            ]
          },
          "150360302": {
            "id": "150360302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What happened? It looked like Skirk just got—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360303"
            ]
          },
          "150360303": {
            "id": "150360303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360304"
            ]
          },
          "150360304": {
            "id": "150360304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "In the Guili Plains, you asked me why this enemy chose you as his target.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360305"
            ]
          },
          "150360305": {
            "id": "150360305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Now, the answer is clear. It's not just the fact that your strength is impressive. It's also because of your ability to, as you put it, \"purify\" Abyssal power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360306"
            ]
          },
          "150360306": {
            "id": "150360306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Whatever that actually means... The fact is that ability allowed him to do something that should have been completely impossible:",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360307"
            ]
          },
          "150360307": {
            "id": "150360307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Namely, break through my defenses and steal my power.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360310"
            ]
          },
          "150360310": {
            "id": "150360310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "No, he couldn't have known I'd come to his domain. He only stole your soul fragment because he knew the value of its power. I doubt he expected it to come in handy so soon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360311"
            ]
          },
          "150360311": {
            "id": "150360311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Call it \"fate\" if you want. I believe that's the term they use in this world for arbitrary coincidences like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360312"
            ]
          },
          "150360312": {
            "id": "150360312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "In any case, it works to our advantage. Once I realized what he was using that power for, it gave me the chance to get back what you lost.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360313"
            ]
          },
          "150360313": {
            "id": "150360313",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But, you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360314"
            ]
          },
          "150360314": {
            "id": "150360314",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "I'll cope.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360315"
            ]
          },
          "150360315": {
            "id": "150360315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Well, done gorging? Good. Time to answer some questions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360316"
            ]
          },
          "150360316": {
            "id": "150360316",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "How did you get the power of the All-Devouring Narwhal?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360317"
            ]
          },
          "150360317": {
            "id": "150360317",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The All-Devouring Narwhal!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360318"
            ]
          },
          "150360318": {
            "id": "150360318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ohh... of course! Paimon knew that spike thing looked familiar! It looks just like that narwhal's horn!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360319"
            ]
          },
          "150360319": {
            "id": "150360319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "I highly doubt you acquired that power through your own strength. Tell me I'm wrong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360320"
            ]
          },
          "150360320": {
            "id": "150360320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "You're desperate enough to scour the land for god remains and whatever vestiges of power you can find. That alone proves you wouldn't be able to defeat a creature like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360321"
            ]
          },
          "150360321": {
            "id": "150360321",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Which leaves one possibility — you know my master, \"The Foul\" Surtalogi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360322"
            ]
          },
          "150360322": {
            "id": "150360322",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "\"The Foul\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360323"
            ]
          },
          "150360323": {
            "id": "150360323",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Who dares call him \"foul\"? Surtalogi...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360324"
            ]
          },
          "150360324": {
            "id": "150360324",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Surta... logi...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360325"
            ]
          },
          "150360325": {
            "id": "150360325",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "What's wrong, bit off more power than you can chew? You're struggling to hold a basic conversation...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360326"
            ]
          },
          "150360326": {
            "id": "150360326",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Just a little longer. I'm still...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360327"
            ]
          },
          "150360327": {
            "id": "150360327",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look! It's back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360328"
            ]
          },
          "150360328": {
            "id": "150360328",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Those obsessed with power will let it devour them before abandoning their pursuit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360329"
            ]
          },
          "150360329": {
            "id": "150360329",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What should we do now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360330"
            ]
          },
          "150360330": {
            "id": "150360330",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Keep calm and use reason to decide the best course of action.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360331"
            ]
          },
          "150360331": {
            "id": "150360331",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Skirk was stabbed by one of the spikes while retrieving the fragment of my soul, and in the process, some of her power was stolen.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360332"
            ]
          },
          "150360332": {
            "id": "150360332",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(The culprit is hiding somewhere beyond the fog. I have a good understanding of his attack pattern from the fight just now. If we pursue him, our chances of winning are high.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360333"
            ]
          },
          "150360333": {
            "id": "150360333",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(But, Skirk's breathing is weaker than usual. If we attack now, I can't guarantee her or Paimon's safety. It's a hard decision to make, but...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360334"
            ]
          },
          "150360334": {
            "id": "150360334",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think we should get out of here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360335"
            ]
          },
          "150360335": {
            "id": "150360335",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Wise decision. Final victory doesn't always come after a single battle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360336"
            ]
          },
          "150360336": {
            "id": "150360336",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "You've got your soul fragment back, so we both got what we came for. Let the enemy draw breath while he can. It won't be for long.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360337"
            ]
          },
          "150360337": {
            "id": "150360337",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "#Get us out of here, {NICKNAME}. You'll need to lead the way this time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503604",
      "subQuestName": "Escape the collapsing Abyss",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503605",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Skirk",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150360501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150360501": {
            "id": "150360501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew... Uh... We should be safe here, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360502"
            ]
          },
          "150360502": {
            "id": "150360502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "I no longer sense his presence. Can't have followed us out of that Abyssal domain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360503"
            ]
          },
          "150360503": {
            "id": "150360503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Weaklings like him will find that my power is not so easily controlled. He won't be leaving that place until he's managed to digest it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360506"
            ]
          },
          "150360506": {
            "id": "150360506",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "You seem surprised.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360507"
            ]
          },
          "150360507": {
            "id": "150360507",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "I suppose that's fair... You've seen but a fraction of what that whale is capable of. That gaping maw could swallow a planet whole.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360508"
            ]
          },
          "150360508": {
            "id": "150360508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "It's called the All-Devouring Narwhal for a reason — \"devouring\" is what it does best. It can extract power from anything, dead or alive, as long as it manages to make physical contact.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360509"
            ]
          },
          "150360509": {
            "id": "150360509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, when we had our run-in with that thing, Neuvillette mentioned that it has an \"instinct to devour\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360510"
            ]
          },
          "150360510": {
            "id": "150360510",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Your dragon friend recognized the nature of its abilities and used the power of Hydro to protect you. That worked because it was in a satiated state, so it was somewhat less aggressive than usual.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360511"
            ]
          },
          "150360511": {
            "id": "150360511",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "It's a different story when it has no more power to feed off of. That's when its true, voracious nature kicks in. It could devour everything on the planet in that state — which is why I cast it into that void space...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360512"
            ]
          },
          "150360512": {
            "id": "150360512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "But, I hadn't counted on there being anyone left on this planet capable of wielding its power. To me, that says he must have encountered the whale a long time ago — meaning, he must have known my master.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360513"
            ]
          },
          "150360513": {
            "id": "150360513",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yeah, hearing you say \"The Foul\" definitely got a reaction out of him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360514"
            ]
          },
          "150360514": {
            "id": "150360514",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Exactly, it told me everything I needed to know. Hence why I said, we both got what we came for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360515"
            ]
          },
          "150360515": {
            "id": "150360515",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "And I believe that brings our transaction to an end. Now that you're whole again, you can get back to your own journey. I'll handle the rest of this situation myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360516"
            ]
          },
          "150360516": {
            "id": "150360516",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No way, we can't leave now! Something was stolen from you because of us! We have to help you get it back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360517"
            ]
          },
          "150360517": {
            "id": "150360517",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "This isn't my first taste of failure or losing power. When you fall, you get back up again and become stronger, that's how it is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360518"
            ]
          },
          "150360518": {
            "id": "150360518",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But... What if that monster finds you before you're all better?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360519"
            ]
          },
          "150360519": {
            "id": "150360519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Plus, how are you gonna get home? It's not like you can just go \"swoosh\" and open a door to the Abyss again. Not without your full strength!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360520"
            ]
          },
          "150360520": {
            "id": "150360520",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, sticking with us for the time being doesn't sound so bad, does it?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503609",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Bubu Pharmacy to rest and recuperate",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
