      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503606",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Bubu Pharmacy to rest and recuperate",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150360601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150360601": {
            "id": "150360601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, this bag from Skirk has a ton of Mora in it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360602"
            ]
          },
          "150360602": {
            "id": "150360602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Does she have a job or something? Wait, no. After what we saw at Wanmin Restaurant, that seems impossible. Can you imagine? It would go something like...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360603"
            ]
          },
          "150360603": {
            "id": "150360603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"I'll be collecting my paycheck now, Boss.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360604"
            ]
          },
          "150360604": {
            "id": "150360604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Oh, sure thing! Wait, who are you? Have we met?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360605"
            ]
          },
          "150360605": {
            "id": "150360605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hm, can't hold a job if you make everyone forget about you. So, what did she do to get all this Mora...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360606"
            ]
          },
          "150360606": {
            "id": "150360606",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Ugh... Claimed some buried treasure, took care of a few monsters that were causing trouble... Nothing untoward. It's safe to use.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360607"
            ]
          },
          "150360607": {
            "id": "150360607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aaaah! You heard all that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360608"
            ]
          },
          "150360608": {
            "id": "150360608",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "A... sonorous voice like yours is hard to miss. I wouldn't be surprised if the sound of it traveled to the nearest mountain top.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360609"
            ]
          },
          "150360609": {
            "id": "150360609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then, did you, by chance, happen to hear Paimon's little, um... joke earlier?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360610"
            ]
          },
          "150360610": {
            "id": "150360610",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "You mean when you called me \"Frosty the Lavender Melon\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360613"
            ]
          },
          "150360613": {
            "id": "150360613",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No, no. Sorry, Paimon totally misspoke just now. She didn't say that at all! It was... a Paimon look-alike! Yeah, she's a piece of work, that one. Always impersonating Paimon and giving people weird nicknames! Hehe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360614"
            ]
          },
          "150360614": {
            "id": "150360614",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#...Okay, fine. The truth is Paimon didn't like you all that much at the start — but things are different now! You helped {NICKNAME} in a big way, so... Whaddaya say? Friends?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360615"
            ]
          },
          "150360615": {
            "id": "150360615",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360616"
            ]
          },
          "150360616": {
            "id": "150360616",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "I noticed there was only one bed. Go ahead and get some rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360617"
            ]
          },
          "150360617": {
            "id": "150360617",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, what about you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360618"
            ]
          },
          "150360618": {
            "id": "150360618",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "I don't get tired, and I don't need rest. I'm going to practice my sword work. That should help me regain some strength.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360619"
            ]
          },
          "150360619": {
            "id": "150360619",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But, your shoulder! Hey! Don't just leave!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360620"
            ]
          },
          "150360620": {
            "id": "150360620",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Argh, whatever. Let her tire herself out. She'll come back eventually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360621"
            ]
          },
          "150360621": {
            "id": "150360621",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Let's get some sleep, {NICKNAME}! That comfy bed is calling Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360622"
            ]
          },
          "150360622": {
            "id": "150360622",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Skirk is stubborn. Even if I tried to convince her to take it easy, I doubt she'd listen.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360623"
            ]
          },
          "150360623": {
            "id": "150360623",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Paimon is right. Skirk will stop and take a break once she gets tired... I hope. I should just get some sleep.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360624"
            ]
          },
          "150360624": {
            "id": "150360624",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "*panting*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360625"
            ]
          },
          "150360625": {
            "id": "150360625",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Skirk...?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360626"
            ]
          },
          "150360626": {
            "id": "150360626",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Of course she's acting like she didn't just get stabbed in the shoulder. Huh, something seems off with her though...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360627"
            ]
          },
          "150360627": {
            "id": "150360627",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "*panting*...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360628"
            ]
          },
          "150360628": {
            "id": "150360628",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "...Quiet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360629"
            ]
          },
          "150360629": {
            "id": "150360629",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Who's she talking to? There's no one around. Unless...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360630"
            ]
          },
          "150360630": {
            "id": "150360630",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bewitching Voice",
            "text": "Do you even remember how many of us perished in that fire? How many bodies were left to rot on the scorched earth? Yet, you alone live on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360631"
            ]
          },
          "150360631": {
            "id": "150360631",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bewitching Voice",
            "text": "Keep your gaze fixed on your blade. You don't deserve to rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360632"
            ]
          },
          "150360632": {
            "id": "150360632",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Bewitching Voice",
            "text": "Run, Skirk... Run! Only death awaits us here. Keep running, and don't ever look back...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360633"
            ]
          },
          "150360633": {
            "id": "150360633",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Right! In that dream I witnessed, Skirk was training alone, but there were disembodied voices talking to her.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360634"
            ]
          },
          "150360634": {
            "id": "150360634",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(One of them mentioned a fire... I wonder what happened exactly. If only she could just talk to us...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360635"
            ]
          },
          "150360635": {
            "id": "150360635",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ahhh, getting an early night's sleep is the best! That bed was sooo comfy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360636"
            ]
          },
          "150360636": {
            "id": "150360636",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, Skirk? Have you been sitting out here the whole night? The bed's all yours if you want it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360637"
            ]
          },
          "150360637": {
            "id": "150360637",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360638"
            ]
          },
          "150360638": {
            "id": "150360638",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Recovered your strength yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360639"
            ]
          },
          "150360639": {
            "id": "150360639",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "About 60 percent, maybe 70.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360640"
            ]
          },
          "150360640": {
            "id": "150360640",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, Paimon thought it would take at least a couple of days! That was fast!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360641"
            ]
          },
          "150360641": {
            "id": "150360641",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "No... Not fast enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360642"
            ]
          },
          "150360642": {
            "id": "150360642",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "That's 20 percent less than last time. Same training regimen, same intensity. Nothing felt different, but somehow, the outcome fell short.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360643"
            ]
          },
          "150360643": {
            "id": "150360643",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Maybe it's because of the spike that stabbed you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360644"
            ]
          },
          "150360644": {
            "id": "150360644",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "No, I think the problem's with me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360645"
            ]
          },
          "150360645": {
            "id": "150360645",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "I need to meditate for the next two days. Deep introspection should help me find the issue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360646"
            ]
          },
          "150360646": {
            "id": "150360646",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, sounds intense! We'll watch over you in the meantime, then!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360647"
            ]
          },
          "150360647": {
            "id": "150360647",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Thanks. See you in two days."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503604",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150360411"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150360411": {
            "id": "150360411",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "From the start, the attacks have been focused on me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360414"
            ]
          },
          "150360414": {
            "id": "150360414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Trying to break through my defenses? I see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360424"
            ]
          },
          "150360424": {
            "id": "150360424",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You alright? That thing was...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150360428"
            ]
          },
          "150360428": {
            "id": "150360428",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "There. I got it back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503650",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150365001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150365001": {
            "id": "150365001",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "He'll know something about Master, I'm sure of it... Next time, I need to be ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150365003",
              "150365006",
              "150365009"
            ]
          },
          "150365003": {
            "id": "150365003",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Fine. It was just a scratch.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150365004"
            ]
          },
          "150365004": {
            "id": "150365004",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "It'll take time to recover my strength, of course, but adapting to situations like this is nothing new for me."
          },
          "150365006": {
            "id": "150365006",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Oh, this? It's a \"Starcrystal Suit.\" Abyssal energy is scarce in Teyvat. Wearing this helps me access it more freely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150365007"
            ]
          },
          "150365007": {
            "id": "150365007",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "It stores concentrated Abyssal energy that I can draw from on the go. When the energy runs out, it reverts back to its original form."
          },
          "150365009": {
            "id": "150365009",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Ah, found somewhere to rest? Well, lead the way then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503651",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150365101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150365101": {
            "id": "150365101",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Baizhu",
            "text": "#You look much better, {NICKNAME}. Should I take it that your health issues are resolved?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150365102"
            ]
          },
          "150365102": {
            "id": "150365102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Changsheng",
            "text": "Hm, your case was a tricky one. Seems slightly too early to celebrate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150365103"
            ]
          },
          "150365103": {
            "id": "150365103",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Baizhu",
            "text": "Very true, Changsheng. Further observation is in order, I think.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150365104"
            ]
          },
          "150365104": {
            "id": "150365104",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Baizhu",
            "text": "We haven't had many patients recently, so we have several vacant rooms. Feel free to stay a few more days if you need.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150365105"
            ]
          },
          "150365105": {
            "id": "150365105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Awesome! Thanks!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1503699",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150369901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150369901": {
            "id": "150369901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*yawn*... Time to go? Finally!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150369902"
            ]
          },
          "150369902": {
            "id": "150369902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Where are we headed?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150369903"
            ]
          },
          "150369903": {
            "id": "150369903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Skirk",
            "text": "Just follow me. I'll open an Abyssal rift close to the culprit's location. It will take us to where he's hiding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150369904"
            ]
          },
          "150369904": {
            "id": "150369904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We should take Skirk somewhere she can rest! Hmm, but where...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150369905"
            ]
          },
          "150369905": {
            "id": "150369905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon gets the feeling Skirk wouldn't like being around a lot of people... Oh, wait! Baizhu said we could rest in the back room of the pharmacy, didn't he? Let's head there!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}